---
const { sequences = [] } = Astro.props;
const glyphs = {
  sun: '☉', moon: '☽', mercury: '☿', venus: '♀', mars: '♂', jupiter: '♃', saturn: '♄'
};
---

{sequences.length > 0 && (
  <section class="time-sequences" id="planetary-time-sequences" aria-labelledby="planetary-time-title">
    <div class="time-head">
      <p class="micro-label">Structured historical reference</p>
      <h2 id="planetary-time-title">Planetary days and hours</h2>
      <p>The named sequences below are source-bound reference systems. The hour sequence is a repeating planetary cycle; the weekday sequence identifies the ruler of each civil weekday. They are related, but they are not the geocentric sphere order.</p>
    </div>

    {sequences.map((sequence) => (
      <div class="sequence-card">
        <div class="sequence-heading">
          <div>
            <h3>{sequence.label}</h3>
            <p>{sequence.sequence_kind === 'hour-cycle' ? 'Repeating hour cycle' : 'Weekday rulers'}</p>
          </div>
          {(sequence.author_name || sequence.work_title) && <span class="source-tag">{[sequence.author_name, sequence.work_title].filter(Boolean).join(' · ')}</span>}
        </div>

        <div class:list={['step-strip', { weekdays: sequence.sequence_kind === 'weekday-rulers' }]}>
          {sequence.steps.map((step) => (
            <a class="step" href={`/terms/${step.planet_slug}/`} title={step.note || undefined}>
              <span class="step-key">{step.step_label}</span>
              <span class="planet-glyph" aria-hidden="true">{glyphs[step.planet_slug] ?? '•'}</span>
              <strong>{step.planet_label}</strong>
            </a>
          ))}
        </div>

        {sequence.notes && <p class="sequence-note">{sequence.notes}</p>}
        {sequence.relation_note && <p class="sequence-note">{sequence.relation_note}</p>}
      </div>
    ))}

    <div class="derivation-note">
      <strong>Why weekday rulers appear in a different order</strong>
      <span>Continue the seven-planet hour cycle without resetting at midnight. The ruler of the first planetary hour after each sunrise advances by three places in the seven-step cycle, producing the familiar weekday order.</span>
    </div>
  </section>
)}

<style>
  .time-sequences{margin:2.8rem 0;padding:1.1rem;border:1px solid var(--line-dark);background:var(--paper-pale)}
  .time-head{max-width:52rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding-bottom:.85rem;margin-bottom:1rem}.time-head h2{margin:.15rem 0 .45rem}.time-head p:last-child{margin:0;color:var(--muted)}
  .sequence-card{margin-top:1rem;padding:.9rem;border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--paper-deep)}
  .sequence-heading{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:1rem;align-items:flex-start;margin-bottom:.75rem}.sequence-heading h3{margin:0}.sequence-heading p{margin:.15rem 0 0;color:var(--muted);font-size:.82rem}.source-tag{font:600 .66rem/1.35 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.05em;color:var(--muted);text-align:right;max-width:20rem}
  .step-strip{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(7,minmax(0,1fr));border:1px solid var(--line-dark)}
  .step{display:grid;grid-template-rows:auto 2rem auto;place-items:center;gap:.25rem;min-width:0;padding:.65rem .35rem;border-right:1px solid var(--line);text-decoration:none;color:inherit;background:var(--paper-pale)}.step:last-child{border-right:0}.step:hover{background:var(--paper-deep)}
  .step-key{font:700 .61rem/1.2 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.04em;color:var(--muted);text-align:center}.planet-glyph{font-size:1.45rem;line-height:1}.step strong{font-size:.78rem;text-align:center}
  .sequence-note{margin:.7rem 0 0;color:var(--muted);font-size:.8rem}
  .derivation-note{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(10rem,.35fr) 1fr;gap:1rem;margin-top:1rem;padding:.8rem;border-left:3px solid var(--line-dark);background:var(--paper-deep)}.derivation-note span{color:var(--muted);font-size:.84rem}
  @media(max-width:760px){.sequence-heading{display:block}.source-tag{display:block;text-align:left;margin-top:.35rem}.step-strip{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr))}.step:nth-child(4){border-right:0}.step:nth-child(-n+4){border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.step:nth-child(7){border-right:0}.derivation-note{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style>
